WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.520
For a new experiment, open New protocol in the project’s Protocols.

2
00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:13.240
Start from a template to create a fillable structure.

3
00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:20.160
Use a clear name. The template remains editable after creation.

4
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:28.600
Edit the instructions visually. Field IDs, types and constraints define the form.

5
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:37.440
Wait for syntax validation. Resolve errors first; valid structure is not scientific validation.

6
00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:45.760
Open Form preview and test example data. Preview values do not create Records.

7
00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:52.880
After checking the form, save and verify the destination and version.

8
00:00:52.880 --> 00:01:00.160
Confirm the save. The Protocol is available in the project for future Records.

9
00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:07.680
Read the saved Protocol. Choose Add Record when collecting observations.
